{"id":"n15989-1-15","stage":0,"title":"멋있다 · 帅气","scene":"穿着与购物","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15989-1-15-1","ko":"새로 산 양복인데 멋있지?","zh":"这是新买的西装，好看吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"새로","meaning":"新买的","explanation":"새로：新地；与后面的 산 合用，表示新买的。","readings":[{"term":"새로","audio":"/audio/06c6c05757e97038ad2a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67896","senseId":"1","lemma":"새로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"새로","audio":"/audio/06c6c05757e97038ad2a.mp3"}},{"text":"산","meaning":"买，购买","explanation":"사다：买，购买；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"사다","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49419","senseId":"1","lemma":"사다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"산","audio":"/audio/ab367eb9a60ab986cced.mp3"}},{"text":"양복인데","meaning":"这件西装","explanation":"양복：西装；-인데 先说明眼前的衣服，再征求评价。","readings":[{"term":"양복","audio":"/audio/c7bd572874f1f999bedd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73257","senseId":"1","lemma":"양복","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"양복인데","audio":"/audio/386c3587be3740a1a5c8.mp3"}},{"text":"멋있지?","meaning":"好看吧","explanation":"멋있다：好看、有型；-지? 向对方确认。","readings":[{"term":"멋있다","audio":"/audio/79ca95990baff4c41958.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15989","senseId":"1","lemma":"멋있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"멋있지","audio":"/audio/93b423bec885aefa78a0.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"06c6c05757e97038","term":"새로","zh":"新","audio":"/audio/06c6c05757e97038ad2a.mp3","entryId":"67896","definition":"从前没有而首次。","pronunciation":["새로"]},{"id":"ee0ee072926e06fc","term":"사다","zh":"买，购买","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3","entryId":"49419","definition":"用钱使某种东西或权利为己所有。","pronunciation":["사다"]},{"id":"c7bd572874f1f999","term":"양복","zh":"西装","audio":"/audio/c7bd572874f1f999bedd.mp3","entryId":"73257","definition":"成年男子的西洋式正装。","pronunciation":["양복"]},{"id":"79ca95990baff4c4","term":"멋있다","zh":"好看、有型","audio":"/audio/79ca95990baff4c41958.mp3","entryId":"15989","definition":"外观出众、有气派；这里评价西装好看。","pronunciation":["머딛따","머싣따"]}],"audio":"/audio/f2ef75532cb6d31ec75e.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n15989-1-15-2","ko":"정말 멋있네. 어디서 샀니?","zh":"真好看。在哪儿买的？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的。","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61174","senseId":"1","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}},{"text":"멋있네.","meaning":"好看啊","explanation":"멋있다：好看、有型；-네 表示看到后发出的感叹。","readings":[{"term":"멋있다","audio":"/audio/79ca95990baff4c41958.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15989","senseId":"1","lemma":"멋있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"멋있네","audio":"/audio/0b76b47ecc568d4df97f.mp3"}},{"text":"어디서","meaning":"在哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里；-서 是 -에서 的缩略，问购买地点。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어디서","audio":"/audio/2239e13aeeae3639dd35.mp3"}},{"text":"샀니?","meaning":"买的","explanation":"사다：买；-았- 表示过去，-니? 是非敬语疑问句末。","readings":[{"term":"사다","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49419","senseId":"1","lemma":"사다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"샀니","audio":"/audio/8ca533770ae038703bee.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61174","definition":"没有虚假而真正地。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"79ca95990baff4c4","term":"멋있다","zh":"好看、有型","audio":"/audio/79ca95990baff4c41958.mp3","entryId":"15989","definition":"外观出众；这里称赞对方的西装。","pronunciation":["머딛따","머싣따"]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3